        ['The cost of a building job varies jointly as the number of workers and the number of days. 6 workers for 10 days cost GH¢9,000. Find the cost for 4 workers for 15 days.', ['GH¢9,000', 'GH¢6,000', 'GH¢13,500', 'GH¢12,000'], 'A', 'k = 150; 150 × 60.', 4],
